From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sysdm.cpl: System Properties opens the Control Panel's own

"rundll32 sysdm.cpl,EditEnvironmentVariables" -- what installers and
guides give to change PATH -- and "sysdm.cpl" in Run said the file could
not be found: Wine has no sysdm.cpl (David 2026-10-01: Claude Code asked
for PATH to be changed). A small one now hands both to the Control Panel
(control.exe, which hands off to sg-shell's): EditEnvironmentVariables
opens its Environment Variables dialog, the item its System page.

Gate: test/sysdm-gate.sh (mutant SG_MUTANT_SYSDM_NOTHING fails it).
---
--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -1441,6 +1441,7 @@
 enable_strmdll
 enable_svrapi
 enable_sxs
+enable_sysdm_cpl
 enable_t2embed
 enable_tapi32
 enable_taskschd
@@ -22797,6 +22798,7 @@
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/svrapi enable_svrapi
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/sxs enable_sxs
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/sxs/tests enable_tests
+wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/sysdm.cpl enable_sysdm_cpl
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/system.drv16 enable_win16
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/t2embed enable_t2embed
 wine_fn_config_makefile dlls/t2embed/tests enable_tests
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -3119,6 +3119,7 @@
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/svrapi)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/sxs)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/sxs/tests)
+WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/sysdm.cpl)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/system.drv16,enable_win16)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/t2embed)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/t2embed/tests)
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/sysdm.cpl/Makefile.in
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+MODULE    = sysdm.cpl
+IMPORTS   = user32 shell32
+
+SOURCES = \
+	sysdm.c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/sysdm.cpl/sysdm.c
@@ -0,0 +1,92 @@
+/*
+ * Stained Glass OS: sysdm.cpl, System Properties
+ *
+ * A front door to the Control Panel's own (sg-shell's, through control.exe,
+ * which hands off to it): "sysdm.cpl" in Run or from a program opens System,
+ * and "rundll32 sysdm.cpl,EditEnvironmentVariables" -- what installers and
+ * guides give to change PATH -- opens the Environment Variables dialog
+ * (David 2026-10-01: Claude Code asked for PATH to be changed). Without
+ * sysdm.cpl both said the file could not be found.
+ *
